Description: FlagTensor Python operators for FlagOS
 Python tensor operators and backend registration used by FlagOS workloads.
 GPU-enabled PyTorch, Triton, and ABI-matched matplotlib are supplied by the
 selected backend runtime.

Package: libflagtensor-nvidia
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libtriton-jit-nvidia (>= 0.1.0-3)
Description: FlagTensor C++ operator runtime (NVIDIA backend)
 Native FlagTensor operators backed by CUDA and the system Triton JIT runtime.
 This package also contains the Triton kernel sources used at runtime.

